# Nothing here is built, so there is nothing to ignore from a build.
# This file exists to make sure the things that must never be committed
# cannot be committed by accident.

# The personal access token lives in localStorage on each device only.
*.token
.env
.env.*
token.txt
secrets.json

# The briefing documents contain his weight, age and measurements.
# This repo is public. They stay out of it.
BUILD-BRIEF.md
6-week-plan.*
weekly-check-in.*

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
